---
import Layout from 'layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="mathcodes.org – Mathematics, All with Code">
  <main class="min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-center items-center px-6 text-center bg-[#21252d] text-[#1b91d6]">
    <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-extrabold mb-6 leading-tight">
      Mathematics,<br />
      Verified by Python.
    </h1>

    <p class="text-lg md:text-xl max-w-2xl mb-8 text-[#8ecae6]">
      Human-authored math challenges where only Python solutions count and every submission is checked by deterministic tests.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center">
      <a
        href="/topics"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 bg-blue-200 text-blue-700 text-lg rounded-xl hover:bg-blue-300 transition font-semibold shadow-md"
      >
        <span class="text-xl">🚀</span>
        <span>Start Exploring</span>
      </a>

      <a
        href="/daily-challenge"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 bg-[#0f1117] border border-blue-200 text-blue-100 text-lg rounded-xl hover:bg-blue-200 hover:text-[#0f1117] transition font-semibold shadow-md"
      >
        <span class="text-xl">🧩</span>
        <span>Try the Daily Code-Arrange</span>
      </a>

      <a
        href="/system-spec"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 bg-transparent border border-blue-200 text-blue-200 text-lg rounded-xl hover:bg-blue-200 hover:text-blue-800 transition font-semibold"
      >
        <span class="text-xl">📜</span>
        <span>Read the System Rules</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </main>

  <section class="bg-[#1a1d26] py-16 text-white text-center px-4">
    <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">What is MathCodes?</h2>
    <p class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-lg text-gray-300">
      MathCodes is an open project designed to help you learn math through computation, visual intuition, and curiosity.
      Every problem is validated with Python—not prose—and follows a transparent specification.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-[#0f1117] py-16 px-4 text-white">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr] gap-8 items-center">
      <div class="bg-[#121826] border border-[#1f2a3a] rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-lg">
        <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-200 mb-2">New • No Backend Needed</p>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3">Daily Code-Arrange Challenge</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-300 mb-4">
          Drag Python blocks into the correct order to solve a human-authored math prompt. When you hit run, we simply reveal
          the stored output—no sandboxing or execution required. It’s a Wordle-style hook for mathematical thinking.
        </p>
        <ul class="text-gray-200 text-sm space-y-2 list-disc list-inside mb-4">
          <li>Instant feedback without server compute</li>
          <li>Teaches logical flow and math structure</li>
          <li>Ready for daily rotations and streaks</li>
        </ul>
        <a
          href="/daily-challenge"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-5 py-3 bg-[#1b91d6] text-[#0b0d14] text-base rounded-xl hover:bg-[#4db3f2] transition font-semibold shadow"
        >
          <span class="text-lg">🧩</span>
          <span>Play today’s puzzle</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[#121826] border border-[#1f2a3a] rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-lg flex flex-col gap-4">
        <div class="bg-[#0b0d14] border border-[#1f2a3a] rounded-xl p-4">
          <p class="text-sm text-blue-200 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1">Example prompt</p>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2">Limit as x → 0 of sin(x)/x</h4>
          <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm">
            Blocks: declare x, build sin(x)/x, ask Sympy for the limit, return the result. The expected output (1.0) is shown
            only after you place everything correctly.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-sm text-gray-200">
          <div class="bg-[#0b0d14] border border-[#1f2a3a] rounded-xl p-3">
            <p class="font-semibold text-white">Daily replay</p>
            <p class="text-gray-300">Puzzles can refresh from YAML/JSON without backend changes.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-[#0b0d14] border border-[#1f2a3a] rounded-xl p-3">
            <p class="font-semibold text-white">Shareable wins</p>
            <p class="text-gray-300">Add streaks, timers, and copyable results for virality.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-[#282c34] py-16 px-4 text-white">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 text-center">
      <div class="bg-[#1f2937] p-6 rounded-xl shadow">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">📐 Visual Explanations</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-300">Understand math through diagrams, graphs, and interactive examples.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-[#1f2937] p-6 rounded-xl shadow">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">📘 Structured Notes</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-300">Explore carefully written Python notes on topics like calculus, differential equations, statistics and more.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-[#1f2937] p-6 rounded-xl shadow">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">💡 Code-Driven Learning</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-300">Solve human-authored problems by writing Python only—each submission is sandboxed and validated against deterministic tests.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer class="bg-[#121417] text-gray-500 py-6 text-sm text-center">
    Built with ❤️ by Ashiful • <a href="mailto:ashiful@mathcodes.org" class="underline">ashiful@mathcodes.org</a>
  </footer>
</Layout>
